8fd0eeca-e286-4a69-8f42-93ca16f24b87	acme-data-migration-20d649	requirements	PRD-D5-01	## Functional Requirements\n- FR-01: Classifier output includes one of {in_scope, out_of_scope, ambiguous} plus a\n  free-text reason string, always populated (never blank).\n- FR-02: "Ambiguous" applies when the ticket's stated work matches a SOW deliverable's\n  *title/theme* but not its acceptance criteria or explicitly touches an EXCLUDES line\n  without being clearly performing the excluded action itself (e.g., a ticket about\n  "improving handover brief accuracy" that turns out to touch scoring language should be\n  flagged ambiguous, not silently classified either way).\n- FR-03: "Out-of-scope" applies only when the ticket's work matches no deliverable AND/OR\n  directly performs something on an EXCLUDES list.\n- FR-04: PM override of any classification is logged with an optional reason, feeding a\n  monthly precision review (not built yet — tracked as FR-05 for a later revision).\n- FR-05 (v2, not this PRD): monthly override-rate dashboard per classification bucket.	{"pm_document_id": "7bb4987e-9858-4e37-8b11-0c696165b607"}	[-0.032479778,-0.028704762,-0.013366091,0.02044475,0.055346917,-0.059388906,0.06681283,-0.019743351,0.046469923,-0.0052957768,0.041272387,-0.033692442,-0.015175125,0.02135668,-0.009883099,0.010501468,0.013796609,0.028272659,-0.027150698,-0.0075705647,0.06516062,-0.0018909697,-0.00600053,0.017995706,0.03548104,0.09170307,0.021459868,-0.039843675,-0.030385448,-0.22830246,-0.0646191,-0.042783678,-0.05163078,-0.0034618645,0.0412944,0.028787445,-0.011294187,-0.030486623,-0.026063114,0.047827356,-0.024570575,0.0064445515,-0.065282986,-0.029800959,-0.03905499,-0.03225873,-0.05556633,-0.010402433,-0.09972458,-0.021278813,0.044699352,-0.06191832,-0.006533291,0.011122202,-0.024346907,0.05245689,-0.025818871,0.044413406,-0.014438179,0.04607649,-0.0023072266,-0.025851801,-0.12011922,0.018684193,-0.011321153,0.05758584,-0.013227013,-0.0889488,-0.015369517,0.0604172,