7e071629-cd2f-42c4-9277-7d200b4f43e7	acme-data-migration-20d649	change_request	CR-002	## Business Reason\nTwo compounding causes, surfaced across KPD-115, KPD-123, and KPD-136:\n1. The linkage matcher underestimated how many of Arclight's historical commit-message\n   conventions needed handling (parenthetical ticket refs, refs buried mid-message, refs\n   split across a commit + its PR title rather than in the commit itself) — three extra\n   convention patterns found during real-corpus testing that weren't in the original\n   sample Arclight provided at kickoff.\n2. Retrieval team velocity ran under plan in Sprints 5–6 (Priya Kumar and Shubhr Aryan\n   were pulled ~30% onto a D3 spike to unblock D7's secrets-scanning integration, which\n   was originally scheduled after D2 but got reprioritized when a false-positive canary\n   issue (KPD-146 class of bug) risked contaminating the eval harness for every other\n   deliverable being tested against it).	{"pm_document_id": "35bf25ea-3c20-4652-bc94-aa21b12bbb48"}	[-0.09036428,-0.003173083,-0.026112879,-0.01910814,0.058822893,-0.04592704,0.008438951,0.014482809,-0.04027549,-0.041683257,0.067853026,0.008305258,0.008277658,-0.010404928,-0.0071849665,0.00042134605,-0.023840776,-0.062110394,-0.0007270393,0.006574053,0.032126706,-0.065826885,0.0046277205,0.013265308,0.015390818,0.05532467,-0.030055853,-0.07999629,-0.015897585,-0.2526556,-0.023181211,0.050305545,-0.021727717,0.0035672665,0.015843956,0.009395626,-0.04623658,0.020679211,0.019415194,-0.0046207886,-0.005850179,-0.011922936,-0.01157978,-0.002301884,-0.00084374123,-0.014361983,0.021238,0.026986767,-0.00406826,0.02544689,0.0051920186,-0.007866628,-0.023833472,0.01808592,0.013440614,0.08071744,0.012199784,0.072904095,-0.023544382,0.010684978,0.019081788,0.005339422,-0.12817363,0.039695002,0.031472716,0.031275187,-0.022213701,-0.05354465,-0.0085072685,0.059440758,-0.0015502136,0.025782881,-0.017636208,-0.013593695,-0.02635086,0.013023314,0.023149652,-0.006132341,0.0259