9ac4b0ab-11f6-42fc-8204-bddb9cf1e145	acme-data-migration-20d649	retro	6f77cfe8-15c9-4fb9-a907-5ef864bb1479	## What Went Poorly\n- Third sprint under committed velocity. Root cause discussed openly: estimates aren't\n  accounting for "convention reality" surprises (same root cause as CR-002) — the team keeps\n  discovering Arclight does things slightly differently than the sample data at kickoff\n  suggested, and it keeps costing a sprint's worth of buffer each time it happens.\n- Agrim's leave was known ~4 days in advance but his in-flight tickets weren't handed off\n  until the day he left — a scramble, not a plan. Nobody's fault specifically, but there's\n  no standing "bus factor" practice for a 6-person team where everyone owns a distinct area.\n- Client communication gap: Dana was surprised D2's coverage number hadn't moved much since\n  CR-002, because nobody proactively told her CR-002 fixed the *date*, not the *progress* —\n  she reasonably assumed approving a CR meant the underlying problem was already solved.	{"pm_document_id": "6f77cfe8-15c9-4fb9-a907-5ef864bb1479"}	[-0.08520872,-0.033746604,-0.04763451,0.003918251,0.025319729,0.0008048336,-0.011058291,0.056515165,0.009168881,0.0090993345,0.035962563,0.009384519,-0.013711785,0.027822105,-0.021989457,0.0051729237,-0.028469056,-0.059160348,0.009734427,0.023584185,0.02972644,-0.066682406,-0.015812982,0.0033728092,0.031914275,0.03566307,-0.011058505,-0.06766611,-0.04662729,-0.23049961,-0.03739526,0.04593422,0.014511678,0.0013158445,0.017697683,-0.009388281,-0.0149970325,0.021010663,0.054754682,0.042325765,-0.027514452,0.0074398145,-0.043864045,-0.030555949,0.005851058,-0.019276304,0.02787771,0.017296037,0.040737987,0.021322384,-0.036724284,0.01941502,-0.012317857,0.0067817853,0.010000192,0.060392823,0.010717415,0.0037521282,0.021647437,-0.012497857,0.030601459,-0.0035681406,-0.1519507,0.028044885,0.04048498,-0.0025548083,-0.013121581,-0.03188821,-0.017661124,0.024218412,-0.010333257,-0.014695081,0.01734188,-0