c066e2ca-aa7b-4343-8ec6-5ab55b686b32	acme-data-migration-20d649	charter	CHARTER-01	internal	1.2	2026-03-01	A. Gupta	final	\N	f	02_project_charter.md	/Users/anyagupta/Documents/idea-explainer-pro/backend/storage/pm_documents/acme-data-migration-20d649/c066e2ca-aa7b-4343-8ec6-5ab55b686b32.md	af1e66c4ad2d9f558b98366b2743683fcae25983dd8fd86e042a126776e238db	confirmed	1	Front matter present and valid — deterministic parse, no LLM call.	\N	{"people": [], "cr_refs": ["CR-002"], "risk_ids": ["R-01", "R-02", "R-03", "R-04"], "ticket_refs": [], "decision_ids": [], "deliverable_ids": ["D1", "D2", "D3", "D4", "D5", "D6", "D7", "D8"], "requirement_ids": []}	agupta	2026-09-14 17:25:43.64131+00	agupta	2026-09-14 17:27:15.45089+00	[{"content": "# Project Charter — Arclight Continuity", "section_path": "(preamble)"}, {"content": "## Problem\\nArclight's engineering org has ~40 engineers across 3 teams and no single place to answer\\n\\"what's the state of X\\" without pinging someone directly. Manager survey (n=14, Feb 2026):\\nmedian time to reconstruct a departing engineer's handover notes is **6.5 hours**, and 9/14\\nmanagers said they'd shipped a regression in the last quarter caused by missing context from\\na rotation. Support/PM Slack channel logged 61 \\"does anyone know why we did X\\" threads in\\nJanuary alone.", "section_path": "Problem"}, {"content": "## Goal\\nShip a queryable, cited knowledge layer over Jira + GitHub, with automated handover briefs,\\nby **2026-11-30** (contract end date) — target: median handover reconstruction time under\\n**45 minutes**, measured via a follow-up manager survey at UAT.", "section_path": "Goal"}, {"content": "## Non-Goals\\n- Not a replacement for Jira/GitHub — read-only layer on top of both.\\n- Not a performance/productivity tracker. Explicitly out of scope per SOW §2 (D4 exclusions).\\n- Not a compliance certification project (SOC 2 etc. is a separate, non-contracted effort).", "section_path": "Non-Goals"}, {"content": "## Ownership\\n- **Sponsor:** Marcus Feld, VP Engineering, Arclight Systems\\n- **DRI (Relay Labs):** Anya Gupta, Delivery Lead\\n- **Client reviewer:** Dana Whitfield, Program Manager, Arclight Systems\\n- **Team (Relay Labs, 6 eng + 1 lead):** A. Gupta (lead), Akshar Kher, Agrim Gairola,\\n  Jason Maro, Omar K, Priya Kumar, Shubhr Aryan — allocation: lead 0.5 FTE, engineers ~0.8\\n  FTE each against this engagement (remainder split across other client work — see Risk R-04\\n  in the risk log for what this costs us when someone's out).", "section_path": "Ownership"}, {"content": "## Budget\\nFixed fee, $214,000 total. 15% ($32,100) due at signing, remainder invoiced per-deliverable\\non UAT acceptance (see Deliverables Matrix for the D1–D8 split). See SOW §5 for the full rate\\ncard used if any deliverable goes to T&M.", "section_path": "Budget"}, {"content": "## Success Metrics\\n- Handover reconstruction time: 6.5 hrs → under 45 min (manager survey, post-UAT)\\n- Ticket-to-commit coverage (D2): ≥85% of Done/In-Progress tickets linked to a commit\\n- Retrieval p95 latency (D3): under 2s at 200k indexed chunks\\n- Zero unremediated secret leaks reaching the searchable index (D7)", "section_path": "Success Metrics"}, {"content": "## Milestones\\n| Milestone | Target Date | Notes |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| Kickoff | 2026-03-02 | Done |\\n| D1 accepted (ingestion live) | 2026-04-30 | Done — accepted 2026-04-24, see UAT-D1 |\\n| D2 accepted (linkage/coverage) | 2026-06-15 | **At risk — see CR-002**, revised target 2026-07-20 |\\n| D3 accepted (hybrid search) | 2026-08-15 | In progress |\\n| D5/D6 accepted (scope + permissions) | 2026-09-30 | In progress |\\n| D4/D7 accepted | 2026-10-31 | In progress / near-done |\\n| D8 accepted, engagement close | 2026-11-30 | Not started — scope confirmation pending |", "section_path": "Milestones"}, {"content": "## Top Risks\\nFull detail lives in the Risk & Issue Log, not restated here (single-writer rule). Currently\\ntracking: R-01 (key-person coverage gap), R-02 (D2 schedule slip), R-03 (D8 scope ambiguity).", "section_path": "Top Risks"}]
