 Issue Log I-05, Closed) — condition satisfied.", "section_path": "Review Against Acceptance Criteria"}, {"content": "## Invoice Authorization\\nMilestone: D1, 8.4% of contract value (per SOW milestone table) → **$16,000** authorized for\\ninvoicing upon this sign-off, per the Deliverables Matrix.", "section_path": "Invoice Authorization"}, {"content": "## Signatures\\n- Dana Whitfield, Program Manager, Arclight Systems — 2026-04-24\\n- Marcus Feld, VP Engineering, Arclight Systems — 2026-04-24\\n- Anya Gupta, Delivery Lead, Relay Labs — 2026-04-24", "section_path": "Signatures"}]
