7c422486-cc04-4dec-b7f9-48c71f5d99cd	e6cb1709-0865-4a3a-b839-f5879578a51b	assistant	The insurance‑card upload feature adds a step to the intake wizard where patients can snap a photo of their insurance card and have the system automatically pull out the member ID, group number and payer name using OCR. The OCR service is called from the client after the image is captured, so the extracted data can be pre‑filled before the patient submits the form. The work was tracked under ticket PIP‑103 and the initial implementation—adding the image‑capture UI and the API request to the OCR endpoint—was committed in c3d4e5f by Damon Reyes [PIP-103][c3d4e5f].	{49113b65-f69b-4c8e-90ba-b502a9dfcf0c,553c288f-c995-486c-9946-9b3a1457a48e}	f	2026-09-13 16:24:50.398879+00	\N	\N	\N	\N
